# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# @astrojs/sitemap can only emit sitemap-index.xml; alias the conventional path.
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 301

# /docs had a card-grid landing page that nothing linked to — not the header
# (which points at quick-start), not the footer, not the Starlight sidebar. It
# was in the sitemap regardless, which is the shape Google files under "orphan".
# It's gone; the path still has to resolve, because knomit's own README links to
# knomit.io/docs from GitHub. Note this fires on Cloudflare only: under
# `astro dev` /docs 404s, which is the price of a real 301 over a meta refresh.
#
# Both forms are listed: a `/docs` rule does NOT match `/docs/`, and the slashed
# form was hard-404ing in production. The target carries its trailing slash so
# the hop lands on the canonical URL directly — targeting `/docs/quick-start`
# made it a two-hop chain (301 here, then Pages' own 308 to add the slash).
/docs /docs/quick-start/ 301
/docs/ /docs/quick-start/ 301
